{c: Verse 1}
[Am],        Pehli Baar Mile Hai
[F] [G] [F],        Milte Hi Dil Ne Kaha
[G] [Am],        Mujhe Pyar Ho Gaya
[Am],        Tumne Pyar Se Dekha
[F] [G] [F],        Jabse Mujhe Mera Dil
[G] [Am],        Bekaraar Ho Gaya
[Am] [G],        Kal Tak Jiske Sapne Dekhe
[G] [F],        Aaj Woh Mere Saath Hai
[F] [G],        Mujhko Ab Yeh Hosh Nahi Hai
