[G] [F],        Karta Hai Yeh Aashiqui
[F] [G],        Tu Hai Chanchal Shok Haseena
[G] [Am],        Tu Hai Meri Zindagi
[Am],        Tere Pyar Mein Jaanam
[F] [G] [F],        Mera Har Din Har Pal
[G] [Am],        Gulzaar Ho Gaya
[Am] [G],        Chhodo Saari Sharm-O-Haya
[G] [F],        Tum Pyar Se Bhi Kutch Kaam Lo
[F] [G],        Aaisa Mauka Jane Na Do
[G] [Am],        Meri Baahen Thaam Lo
[Am] [G],        Har Seene Ki Dhadkan Main Hu
[G] [F],        Har Dil Mujhpe Hai Fida
[F] [G],        Lekin Mere Dil Ko Bhaaye
[G] [Am],        Zaalim Teri Hi Adaa
[Am],        Dil Pe Aaj Hamare
[F] [G] [F] [G] [Am],        Ab Toh Sanam Tera Ikhtiyaar Ho Gaya
[Am] [G],        Dilkash Aankhen Nikhra Chehra
[G] [F],        Sheeshe Jaisa Yeh Badan
[F] [G],        Aaise Chamke Roop Tumhara
[G] [Am],        Jaise Paani Mein Kiran
[Am] [G],        Shaharon Ki In Galiyon Mein Hai
[G] [F],        Charche Tere Naam Ke
[F] [G],        Itne Saare Husn Ke Jalwe
[G] [Am],        Pyar Bina Kis Kaam Ke
